---------------------------------------------------
	sotm_use = %sotm_use%
	[1 = Use new, less cheesy items (recommended)
	 2 = Use original, overpowered items]
	sotm_equip = %sotm_equip%
	{1 = Add items to creatures' equipment (recommended)
	 2 = Add items to creatures' inventory]
---------------------------------------------------~
